  "title": [
    "[Illithien Aerie, Courtyard]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "Starlight glimmers off windows set into an arched stone gatehouse fitted with several hitching rings.  Branching from the archway is an elevated stone aqueduct encircling the grassy courtyard.  Carved into the mountainside in graceful bas-relief is an intricate facade set with paned windows that terminates at the top of a high ridge.  Two slender marble columns flank a tall engraved copper doorway.  A small platform encased in a scrollworked vertical truss is set to one side of the facade."
  ],
